 ("Why switch from pods to tabs?", "Same one-and-done dosing, but Just 7 skips the PVA film entirely." + P),
 ("What's a laundry tablet?", "A pressed solid detergent you drop in the drum. Just 7 Laundry Tabs are laundry tablets."),
